<div xmlns:perseus="http://www.perseus.org/meta/perseus.rdfs#" xmlns:dctype="http://purl.org/dc/dcmitype/" xmlns:tufts="http://www.tufts.edu/" xmlns:alph="http://alpheios.net/namespaces/tei" class="alpheios-lex-text_container en">
    <div class="alpheios-lex-entry" lemma-id="n45163" body-key=""><b><span class="alpheios-lex-la" lang="lat">spurco</span></b> , no <div class="alpheios-lex-lex_sense alpheios-lex-lex_sense1"><b>I.</b><i>perf.</i>, ātum, 1,
				v. a.
			id., <i>to make filthy</i>, <i>to befoul</i>, <i>defile</i> (rare;
			syn.: polluo, contamino). </div>
        <div class="alpheios-lex-lex_sense alpheios-lex-lex_sense1"><b>I.</b>
			<b>Lit.</b>: 
				“<span class="alpheios-lex-la" lang="lat">si quis fimo aliquem pertuderit, luto
					oblinierit, aquā spurcaverit,</span>”
				 <i><span class="en">Dig.
					47, 11, 1</span></i>
			: 
				“<span class="alpheios-lex-la" lang="lat">vinum,</span>”
				 <i><span class="en">ib.
					9, 2, 27</span></i>
			: 
				“<span class="alpheios-lex-la" lang="lat">ex istoc loco spurcatur nasum odore inlutili,</span>”
				 <i><span class="en">Plaut. Men. 1, 2, 57</span></i>
			.—* </div>
        <div class="alpheios-lex-lex_sense alpheios-lex-lex_sense1"><b>II.</b>
			<b>Trop.</b>: 
				“<span class="alpheios-lex-la" lang="lat">senectus Spurcata impuris moribus,</span>”
				 <i><span class="en">Cat.
					108, 2</span></i>
			.—<i>P. a.</i>: <b><span class="alpheios-lex-la" lang="lat">spurcātus</span></b> , a, um, <i>sup.</i>: 
				“<span class="alpheios-lex-la" lang="lat">helluo spurcatissimus,</span>”
				<i>most foul</i>,
				 <i><span class="en">Cic.
					Dom. 10, 25</span></i>
			 B. and K.</div>
    </div> <div class="alpheios-lex-footnotes en"> </div>
